  "description": "Given two strings, haystack and needle, return the index of the first occurrence of needle in haystack, or -1 if needle is not part of haystack. This trace uses the naive string matching algorithm.",
  "pseudocode": "function strStr(haystack, needle) {\n  const n = haystack.length;\n  const m = needle.length;\n\n  if (m === 0) {\n    return 0;\n  }\n\n  // Iterate through haystack with a window of size 'm'\n  for (let i = 0; i <= n - m; i++) {\n    let found = true;\n    // Compare the substring haystack[i...i+m-1] with needle\n    for (let j = 0; j < m; j++) {\n      if (haystack[i + j] !== needle[j]) {\n        found = false;\n        break; // Mismatch found, move to next 'i'\n      }\n    }\n    if (found) {\n      return i; // Full match found, return starting index\n    }\n  }\n\n  return -1; // Needle not found in haystack\n}",
